    "preamble": "Alkesh Yadav vs Department Of Public Health And Family ... on 22 February, 2024 Author: Pranay Verma Bench: Pranay Verma 1 In The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh At Indore Before Hon'Ble Shri Justice Pranay Verma On The 22 nd Of February, 2024 Writ Petition No. 19302 of 2020 Between:- Alkesh Yadav S/O Shri Shravan Kumar Yadav, Aged About 32 Years, Occupation: Service Drug Inspector, Food And Drugs Administration, Indore, R/O; 120, Vip, Paraspar Nagar, Indore (Madhya Pradesh) .. (By Shri L. C. Patne - Advocate) And 1. State Of M.P. Through Principal Secretary To The Govt. Of M.P. Department Of Public Health And Family Welfare Vallabh Bhawan Mantralaya Bhopal (Madhya Pradesh) 2 . Commissioner Of Food Safety And C O N T R O L L E R Food And Drug Ad M In Istr Ation . Idgah Hills Bhopal (Madhya Pradesh) 3. Joint Controller Food And Drug Ad M In Is Tr Ation Idgah Hills Bhopal (Madhya Pradesh) 4. Shri Prem Kumar Dongre, Drug Inspector Office Of Deputy Director, Food And Drug Administration, M.Y. Hospital Campus, Indore (Madhya Pradesh) ..... (BY SHRI SHREY RAJ SAXENA - DEPUTY ADVOCATE GENERAL SHRI PIYUSH JAIN - ADVOCATE FOR RESPONDENT NO.4) Alkesh Yadav vs Department Of Public Health And Family ... on 22 February, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/76290789/ 1 This petition coming on for admission this day, th e co Signature Not Verified following: Signed by: SHILPA NAGDEVE Signing time: 22-02-2024 18:03:06 2 ORDER Learned counsel for respondent No.4 has informed that respondent No.4 has expired.",
    "facts": "02. By this petition preferred under Article 226 of the Constitution of India, the petitioner has challenged his transfer orders dated 18.03.2020 (Annexure P/7), 24.03.2020 (Annexure P/11) and 04.12.2020 (Annexure P/19).",
